      290.11,
      455.84,
      347.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends the Recovery of Loans by Banks (Special Provisions)Act, No. 4 of 1990 by inserting immediately after section 4 of that Act, new section 4Aand the legal effect as amended is to suspend, the selling of any property mortgaged to thebank as security for any loan in respect of which default has been made, by public auctionduring the period commencing on the date of commencement of section 4A and ending on15th December, 2024.",
